    {
      "id": "1309179788946078",
      "score": 4,
      "review_title": "Developers, please read this!",
      "review_description": "Hello, developers of the game Ape Containment! I really like the game because it's very fun to play with friends and other players. I want to write to you about what you could add in the next update/updates: Please add 5 new monsters named Slender (Redux version), Claw (Redux version), Grim, SawRunner, and Lost (Redux version). Fix the jumpscare of the monster named Gary, because when Gary's jumpscare plays, he gets a different texture like the player's — just replace that jumpscare with a different one. Please make it so that gold can be used to buy clothes in the shop. Make it so that when entering the game, a message saying \"Welcome to Ape Containment\" appears and the music \"Tophats N' Tools - Solar.mp3 (ChimpLab VR OST)\" plays. Make it so that after death, the player's dead body appears. Please make the sound of the monster Kus be the original version of the song \"Wake Up the President\", not a modified one. Add eyes to the monster Kus (left eye white, right eye green). Add a monster room to the lobby. Add jumpscares to all monsters. Add a new location called \"Labyrinth with blue and white walls\" and in that location there will be monsters Slender and SawRunner. Add a boombox to the game. Fix the glass bug. Make it so that when the elevator moves, it is in real time with all players (if there are 2 or more players in the elevator and one of them presses the elevator launch button, everyone else will stay downstairs except the person who pressed it, because other people will see that person just floating, but in reality they are riding the elevator). Replace the lobby music with \"Lethal Ape Redux lobby theme\". I have one last request: please do not add more monsters (except the ones I listed), because there are already quite a few of them, please do not make it so that players can buy a mod menu, because that would really ruin the game, and lastly, do not remove the monsters that have been added, because they fit very well into the game. Thank you in advance!",
      "date": 1788616591,
      "review_helpful_count": 7,
